  "foundations-15": { cpp: "// T(n) = a*T(n/b) + f(n)  ->  barglar: n^(log_b a)\n// merge sort:    T(n) = 2T(n/2) + O(n)   -> O(n log n)\n// binary search: T(n) =  T(n/2) + O(1)   -> O(log n)\n// Karatsuba:     T(n) = 3T(n/2) + O(n)   -> O(n^1.585)", python: "# T(n) = a*T(n/b) + f(n)  ->  barglar: n^(log_b a)\n# merge sort:    T(n) = 2T(n/2) + O(n)   -> O(n log n)\n# binary search: T(n) =  T(n/2) + O(1)   -> O(log n)\n# Karatsuba:     T(n) = 3T(n/2) + O(n)   -> O(n^1.585)" },
